W33: Controls, monitors, XKB, mouse binds, include, and IPC (0.2.8)

Date: 2026-11-26
Agent: agy (Gemini)
Branch: dev

SUMMARY

  Implemented Tamlinux 0.7.0 Milestone 6 engine primitives in tam-pane 0.2.8:
  - Added `tp.monitor{ output, mode, position, scale, transform, enabled/disabled }`
    and `tp.clear_monitors()` with atomic staging/rollback, startup application
    in `on_new_output`, and live reload application in `tp_monitors_apply_config`.
  - Added XKB (`kb_layout`, `kb_variant`, `kb_model`, `kb_options`, `kb_rules`,
    `numlock_by_default`) and pointer (`natural_scroll`, `scroll_factor`)
    configuration in `tp.config`, applied on attach and live reload.
  - Added `tp.home`, `tp.config_dir`, and bounded `tp.include(path[, optional])`
    so packaged defaults can load personal overrides cleanly across reloads.
  - Extended `tp.bind` with `code:<9..255>` keycodes and `{ release = true }`,
    added `tp.mouse_bind`/`tp.mouse_unbind` (`mouse:272..279`, `mouse_up`,
    `mouse_down`) with `tp.dsp.mouse_move()`/`tp.dsp.mouse_resize()`, and
    added `tp.dsp.focus("left"|"right"|"up"|"down")`, `tp.dsp.send_key`,
    and `tp.dsp.capture`.
  - Extended IPC: `id` and `pid` on `windows`/`focused`, `phys_w`/`phys_h`/
    `refresh`/`transform` on `monitors`, `code:<N>` + `desc` on `binds`, and
    `dispatch focus <dir>`, `dispatch send_key <chord>`, `dispatch capture <cmd>`,
    and `dispatch monitor scale <output|focused> <scale>`.
  - Added unit tests in `tests/test_lua.c` and `tests/test_ipc.c`.
